# Incomplete-run archives and worker convenience dumps
postanalysis/llm_agent/adjudication/_full_clear_*/
postanalysis/llm_agent_v3/adjudication/_pre_agent_queue_*/
postanalysis/llm_agent/adjudication/decisions/claims/_*/
